v><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Qalam — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</h1><section><p>Aya za sura hii zenye maelezo:</p><div class=\"vl\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/68-1.html\">1</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/68-2.html\">2</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/68-4.html\">4</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/68-35.html\">35</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/68-36.html\">36</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/68-42.html\">42</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/68-43.html\">43</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/68-48.html\">48</a></div></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s68a1\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}